# newt-arm1-oci — Environment Variables
#
# ADDED 2026-08-15 (per the 2026-08-15-bonneagar-infra-remediation-v2
# openspec change). Every env var the stack consumes is documented here.
#
# MANDATORY (provided by mise + Infisical hydration):
#   INFISICAL_URL                       — Infisical base URL
#   INFISICAL_CLIENT_ID                  — Universal Auth client_id (the bons-iac machine identity)
#   INFISICAL_PROJECT_ID                 — Infisical workspace UUID
#   INFISICAL_ENV                        — environment (default "dev")
#   INFISICAL_SECRET_FILE                — path to the infisical_secret file (mounted via Docker secrets)
#
# OPTIONAL (have defaults):
#   PANGOLIN_ENDPOINT                   — Pangolin base URL (default https://pangolin.cianfhoghlaim.ie)
#
# SECRET (NOT set via .env — resolved by Locket at runtime):
#   PANGOLIN_CLIENT_ARM1_OCI_ID         — the public client_id (16 chars) — Infisical /pangolin/clients/arm1-oci/
#   PANGOLIN_CLIENT_ARM1_OCI_SECRET     — the write-only client_secret (32 chars) — Infisical /pangolin/clients/arm1-oci/
#
# HOW TO MINT THE PANGOLIN CLIENT:
#   bun run iac:bootstrap-pangolin-client --host=arm1-oci --type=machine
#
# AFTER MINTING:
#   cd /etc/komodo/sruth/bonneagar/stacks/newt-arm1-oci
#   docker compose up -d